  "description": "<p data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"413\">Ervaar ultieme prestaties met de <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"154\">iPhone 16 Pro</strong> in de elegante kleur <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"194\">White Titanium</strong>. Deze nieuwste generatie iPhone combineert kracht, design en duurzaamheid in één toestel. Dankzij de <strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"312\">A18 Pro-chip</strong> en het <strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"356\">heldere Super Retina XDR-display</strong> is alles razendsnel, vloeiend en indrukwekkend scherp.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"448\">💡 <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"446\">Belangrijkste kenmerken:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<li data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"506\">\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"506\">⚙️ Apple A18 Pro-chip – extreem snel en energiezuinig</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"536\">💾 128GB opslagcapaciteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"565\">🎨 Kleur: White Titanium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"623\">📸 Geavanceerd 48MP Pro-camerasysteem met 5x telelens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"682\">🌈 6,3-inch Super Retina XDR-display (120Hz ProMotion)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\">🔋 Batterijconditie: <strong data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"714\">100%</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"772\">🧠 Draait op <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"742\">iOS 26</strong> – de nieuwste generatie iOS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"816\">🔐 Face ID, MagSafe & draadloos opladen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\">💼 <strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"834\">Levering:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"877\">iPhone 16 Pro – 128GB White Titanium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"902\">\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"902\">Originele verpakking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"922\">USB-C laadkabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1042\">De iPhone verkeert in <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"960\">nieuwstaat</strong>, zonder gebruikssporen en technisch 100% in orde. Klaar om direct te gebruiken!</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1152\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1152\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Een topklasse iPhone met titanium afwerking en perfecte batterij – als nieuw, voor een scherpe prijs!</strong></p>",
